  "ruleText": "Ins 3311.01 Penalty Provision. Any violations of these rules shall be subject to such suspension or revocation of certificate of authority or license, or administrative fine not to exceed $2,500 per violation, as may be applicable under Title XXXVII.\n\nSource. #9634, eff 7-1-10; ss by #12599, eff 8-3-18\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRegulation | Statute\n\nIns 3301.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3301.02 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3301.03 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 402-J; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3301.04 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 541-A:22, IV\n\nIns 3302.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I; RSA 417:4 VIII(e)\n\nIns 3303.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I; RSA 417:4, VIII(e); RSA 417-A; RSA 417-B\n\nIns 3304.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I; RSA 417:4, VIII(g)\n\nIns 3305.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3305.02 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3306.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3307.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3308.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I; RSA 417:4, VIII(e) & (g); RSA 417:27; RSA 417-A; RSA 417-B\n\nIns 3308.02 | RSA 91-A:5; RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 400-A:16; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3309.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 400-B:4; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:16; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3309.02 | RSA 400-A;15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I\n\nIns 3310.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I; RSA 417:4 VIII(g); RSA 417-A; RSA 417-B\n\nIns 3311.01 | RSA 400-A:15, I & III; RSA 412:15, III; RSA 412:43, I; RSA 412:40",
